XRLF.3.FORMATTING.SPEC.START

This file enforces the formatting rules defined in the root XRLF.CONTRACT.XRLF.
All agents must validate against these rules before any commit.

RULES:
  SectionHeadings:
    - One blank line before each section heading.
    - No blank line after a section heading.

  PrincipleBlocks:
    - Format: PRINCIPLE_X (Name): followed by indented text.
    - No blank line between headline and text.
    - One blank line after each principle block.

  Paragraphs:
    - Indented by two spaces.
    - Maximum one blank line of separation.

  Lists:
    - Items begin with "-".
    - Indented by four spaces.
    - Nested lists prohibited.
    - One blank line after each list block.

  LineIntegrity:
    - No trailing spaces.
    - No tabs; only spaces.
    - No additional blank lines beyond those defined.

  Enforcement:
    - Validate formatting before any transformation.
    - Halt and repair if violations detected.
    - No commit until fully compliant.

XRLF.3.FORMATTING.SPEC.END